## How to Compile and Run

```bash
g++ stackarray.cpp -o stackarray
./stackarray
```

Same way for the other programs:

```bash
g++ queuearray.cpp -o queuearray && ./queuearray
g++ stacklinklist.cpp -o stacklinklist && ./stacklinklist
g++ queuelinklist.cpp -o queuelinklist && ./queuelinklist
```

